    12662         for each ub.c-gds-dtl no-lock
    12663             where ub.c-gds-dtl.doc-code = ub.trn-doc.doc-code
    12664         on error undo, return error substitute( "&1. &2&3&4", vss-workfile, return-value, chr(10), error-status :get-message ( error-status :num-messages ) )
    12665         :
